WEBVTT

00:09.030 --> 00:13.570
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Student, Sixth Year
Will Serfort</b>

00:09.090 --> 00:11.180
<i>What just happened?</i>

00:11.180 --> 00:13.200
<i>Did I get hit?</i>

00:16.770 --> 00:18.300
<i>The sea of trees is....</i>

00:23.080 --> 00:26.000
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Student, Sixth Year
Sion Ulster</b>

00:23.210 --> 00:26.000
Leave, Julius. You're in the way.

00:28.040 --> 00:29.500
<i>He was aiming for Julius...</i>

00:29.770 --> 00:33.050
<i>No, Julius </i>and<i> Will.</i>

00:33.880 --> 00:36.260
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Student, Sixth Year
Colette Loire</b>

00:34.240 --> 00:36.260
What are you thinking, Sion?!

00:36.260 --> 00:40.260
I've stayed quiet and played your game 
up until now, haven't I, Colette?

00:40.790 --> 00:43.070
So now I demand my due.

00:44.120 --> 00:47.020
Fight me, laggard.

00:48.710 --> 00:51.390
<i>What is he talking about?</i>

00:52.220 --> 00:54.900
Here? Now? You and me, Sion?

00:54.900 --> 00:55.820
Why?

00:59.980 --> 01:05.540
You're an offense to the ears and eyes! 
I don't need a reason to crush you!

01:06.220 --> 01:07.710
<i>Where is this coming from?</i>

01:08.170 --> 01:09.660
Stop, Sion!

01:17.740 --> 01:19.710
<i>Julius?</i>

01:18.430 --> 01:22.560
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Student, Sixth Year
Julius Reinberg</b>

01:19.710 --> 01:22.180
<i>It can't be! How did he escape 
that bombardment?</i>

01:22.680 --> 01:23.680
Ice over.

01:25.470 --> 01:26.330
Colette!

01:36.990 --> 01:40.870
Sion, please stop this! 
This is no time to be fighting each other!

01:43.660 --> 01:46.970
Hurry up and grab your sword, laggard.

03:31.270 --> 03:35.360
Episode 6
Between Pride and Passion

03:43.490 --> 03:48.120
"I'm a worthless no-talent."

03:44.530 --> 03:48.120
<i>He was pathetic from the very beginning.</i>

03:48.950 --> 03:52.220
<i>So utterly pathetic, 
it was distressing to behold.</i>

03:54.170 --> 03:58.630
<i>That's why I thought I'd make him 
less painful to watch.</i>

03:59.330 --> 04:00.270
Sion?

04:08.360 --> 04:10.640
I'll let you be one of my underlings.

04:11.020 --> 04:14.140
That way, you won't feel so wretched all the...

04:18.390 --> 04:19.310
Hey!

04:20.510 --> 04:22.490
Don't ignore me!

04:27.980 --> 04:29.240
Please get out of my way.

04:43.540 --> 04:45.260
<i>But he...</i>

04:46.200 --> 04:50.620
<i>He never even once saw us 
blotting the landscape.</i>

05:05.240 --> 05:07.060
<i>Ever since that day...</i>

05:08.030 --> 05:11.040
<i>I've despised him.</i>

05:16.970 --> 05:17.750
Lansear!

05:24.920 --> 05:27.470
Entangle, briars of flame!

05:36.190 --> 05:37.880
O flames, obey me!

05:37.880 --> 05:39.360
Ignis Rooks!

05:45.780 --> 05:49.070
Jumping around like an animal... 
Are you only concerned with survival?

05:49.360 --> 05:51.080
Come and attack me!

05:53.270 --> 05:54.330
I can't do that!

05:54.330 --> 05:55.790
Fight me!

05:56.520 --> 05:59.610
We're on the same team.

05:59.610 --> 06:01.130
Besides...

06:01.130 --> 06:04.040
if I'm going to keep my promise 
to Mister Donnan and the others,

06:04.040 --> 06:06.250
I can't do this with you right now!

06:06.250 --> 06:07.660
Don't mess with me!

06:07.660 --> 06:11.050
If you're not going to fight, 
I'll just burn you to cinders!

06:12.620 --> 06:15.270
<i>Is fighting him really my only choice?</i>

06:15.980 --> 06:19.870
What's this?! What's going on over there?

06:19.270 --> 06:22.520
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Student, Sixth Year
Rosty Nowman</b>

06:19.870 --> 06:22.520
Squad 6 had been making steady progress,

06:22.830 --> 06:27.680
but now teammates 
Will and Sion are fighting each other!

06:26.490 --> 06:29.530
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Professor
Workner Norgram</b>

06:27.680 --> 06:29.530
What an unexpected falling out!

06:29.850 --> 06:33.300
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Student, Sixth Year
Mike Maius</b>

06:29.850 --> 06:34.300
What's your take on the situation?
Fill us in, Professor Edward!

06:35.610 --> 06:40.220
Whatever the reason might be, fighting 
amongst team members is out of the question.

06:35.870 --> 06:40.580
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Professor
Edward Serfence</b>

06:40.220 --> 06:42.840
Even considering the core
principals of the Crown Attack,

06:42.840 --> 06:47.800
we can assume the tower scouts will see
 this as a significant mark against them.

06:48.600 --> 06:52.940
Yes, it truly is deplorable.

06:54.340 --> 06:56.600
I-I see.

06:56.600 --> 06:59.390
<i>He looks so happy saying that!</i>

07:00.060 --> 07:01.830
Sion Ulster...

07:02.230 --> 07:06.070
Up until now, he'd been advancing 
with outstanding brilliance.

07:06.360 --> 07:08.800
In the end, he's just a schoolboy.

07:08.800 --> 07:12.220
With the credits he's earned, 
he's fourth in his year,

07:12.220 --> 07:14.070
but this issue eclipses that.

07:14.430 --> 07:16.400
What is Sion doing?

07:14.620 --> 07:19.200
<b>Familiar
Kiki</b>

07:16.400 --> 07:19.000
I've never seen teammates fight before.

07:22.140 --> 07:24.660
I know. I'm worried, too.

07:26.260 --> 07:28.100
I wonder what's going to happen.

07:28.100 --> 07:29.880
May I sit here?

07:30.930 --> 07:33.150
You're... Iris, right?

07:33.150 --> 07:37.350
That's right! I'm Iris, the underclassman 
who can get along with anyone!

07:37.470 --> 07:41.480
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Student, Fourth Year
Iris Churchill</b>

07:37.810 --> 07:40.840
It's been a while, hasn't it, Rosty?

07:42.270 --> 07:44.340
So, may I sit next to you?

07:44.340 --> 07:46.890
I've been standing this whole time!

07:47.500 --> 07:48.400
Go right ahead.

07:48.400 --> 07:49.900
Thank you!

07:50.680 --> 07:54.540
Will! You can do it!

07:55.190 --> 08:00.100
How unexpected. I never thought you'd
 be cheering for someone in particular, Iris.

08:00.100 --> 08:03.000
I figured you for the type 
to follow the crowd.

08:03.530 --> 08:08.570
To tell you the truth, I heard
 about Will from a certain someone.

08:08.570 --> 08:11.510
At first, I wasn't especially interested...

08:13.790 --> 08:16.430
But now I'm completely obsessed!

08:17.290 --> 08:18.760
Really?

08:23.050 --> 08:27.390
There's Sion, who he's fighting right now, 
and you... Will sure is popular.

08:27.390 --> 08:30.030
And you as well, right, Rosty?

08:30.710 --> 08:32.190
But of course.

08:32.190 --> 08:35.080
After all, I love Will more than anything.

08:35.980 --> 08:38.780
Love is a heavy burden, isn't it?

08:39.120 --> 08:41.290
Well, he's my roommate, you know?

08:42.140 --> 08:46.510
Oh. There's also Miss Colette,
I'm pretty sure.

08:51.550 --> 08:54.300
<i>I have to hurry up and stop those two, but...</i>

08:55.050 --> 08:56.300
<i>There's Julius!</i>

08:57.000 --> 08:58.730
What's wrong, Colette?

08:59.420 --> 09:02.810
If all you do is run, no one will think
you worthy of your Earth Princess title.

09:03.450 --> 09:05.310
Don't you call me that!

09:05.310 --> 09:08.310
The next time you do, 
I'll beat you black and blue!

09:10.060 --> 09:11.570
Enough already!

09:17.270 --> 09:19.520
<i>He used the blast to set off a trap?</i>

09:27.460 --> 09:31.090
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Student, Sixth Year
Flip Marteau</b>

09:27.460 --> 09:31.090
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Student, Sixth Year
Palm Snoke</b>

09:27.560 --> 09:30.430
Hey, this is kinda weird, isn't it?

09:30.430 --> 09:31.090
Huh?

09:32.230 --> 09:34.990
You're right. Wh-Why...

09:34.990 --> 09:37.090
Why are there so many Juliuses?!

09:38.990 --> 09:42.550
Julius? What are you doing here?

09:40.470 --> 09:43.100
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Student, Sixth Year
Emma Klever</b>

09:49.570 --> 09:51.390
Hey, Julius.

09:49.730 --> 09:54.190
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Student, Sixth Year
Wignall Lindor</b>

09:51.390 --> 09:54.610
Have you come to see me just 
as you proclaimed you would?

09:55.070 --> 09:58.290
Indeed. I told you I declared war, did I not?

09:58.290 --> 10:01.710
And that I'd use my secret 
weapon to crush you all.

10:01.710 --> 10:02.870
I see.

10:03.230 --> 10:06.120
Well, before that, allow me 
to return your gift of a flower.

10:19.670 --> 10:22.210
Thank you, Master Wignall.

10:19.760 --> 10:24.350
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Student, Sixth Year
Karen Mainy</b>

10:19.760 --> 10:24.350
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Student, Sixth Year
Terry Foro</b>

10:22.210 --> 10:27.770
What's going on? Why would Julius 
go to the trouble of coming out here?

10:28.610 --> 10:30.780
That was well done, Julius.

10:32.550 --> 10:35.780
<i>Who'd have imagined he had
a trick like this up his sleeve?</i>

10:37.460 --> 10:40.170
<i>This is one of the Magia Vander's...</i>

10:40.890 --> 10:43.870
I have no idea what's going on,

10:43.870 --> 10:47.790
but Julius suddenly appeared 
only to get shut down by Squad 12!

10:48.110 --> 10:51.650
We'd expect nothing less from the elves! 
That's Master Wignall for you!

10:51.650 --> 10:53.790
Keep up the fight, my life savings!

10:54.610 --> 10:59.300
What's your assessment of
 our kinsman at the academy.

11:00.150 --> 11:03.920
Average. He neither exceeds 
nor fails to meet expectations.

11:00.300 --> 11:05.140
<b>Elf Faction Aide-de-Camp
Filvis Challia</b>

11:03.920 --> 11:05.820
That's quite harsh.

11:05.820 --> 11:08.820
More importantly, Lefiya, 
I want to go back this instant.

11:09.250 --> 11:12.560
For an introvert like me,
 this festival atmosphere is insufferable.

11:12.560 --> 11:13.470
I want to die.

11:13.470 --> 11:14.600
Well, you can't.

11:13.560 --> 11:18.320
<b>Elf Faction Aide-de-Camp
Lefiya Viridis</b>

11:14.600 --> 11:18.430
This is a festival for the
 inhabitants of paradise, the Rhizanth.

11:19.540 --> 11:24.150
Now, how shall we report this to Lady Ellenor?

11:25.130 --> 11:29.440
I wonder if the winner will come down 
to Julius and Master Wignall.

11:29.440 --> 11:33.730
Squad 6 was really close. 
If Sion hadn't gone and done that, then...

11:33.730 --> 11:39.920
I mean, I don't want the no-talent to win, 
but this is unprecedented, right?

11:38.170 --> 11:42.340
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Student, Sixth Year
Gordon Vally</b>

11:40.530 --> 11:43.220
What's gotten into Sion?

11:43.630 --> 11:47.010
I know he hates the laggard,

11:47.660 --> 11:50.460
but to pull this at the
 Grand Magic Festival is just...

11:51.220 --> 11:53.580
What is he so angry about?

11:54.670 --> 11:58.940
I kind of understand how Sion feels.

11:54.810 --> 11:59.150
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Student, Sixth Year
Lyril Mars</b>

11:58.940 --> 11:59.730
Huh?

11:59.730 --> 12:01.920
Trying to get him kicked out of the academy

12:01.920 --> 12:05.560
because he didn't get his way 
may be going too far,

12:07.300 --> 12:09.560
but I'm sure that Sion is...

12:15.510 --> 12:18.900
<i>Why is Sion so fixated on me?</i>

12:20.420 --> 12:21.630
Halcon Wand

12:21.970 --> 12:25.050
<b><u>Sion Ulster</u>

Race: Rhizanth
 Age: 16
Height: 171 cm
Birthday:
13th of Nullsmoon
Likes: Marshmallows generously covered in honey
(He's never told anyone this)
Dislikes: No-talents who won't even look at him
First Love: The Colette Loire of five years ago

Deepest Dungeon Floor Reached: 6th
Equipment: Halcon wand, shirt and leather boots 
from the nobility-exclusive brand, Lesaile
Skills: Fire magic, mostly mid and low rank spells,
plus the advanced spell Conflagration Hill
(Iflamme Burdelyon)

Heir to the House of Ulster, masters of magical flame.
He has one younger sister. An incident when he was
a first-year made him keenly aware of Will, who
he saw as an enemy.</b>

12:27.300 --> 12:30.060
<b><u>Mercedes Caulis, the Wizard's Tower</u>
"It looks like a stalk that could snap at any moment."
-A certain mage queen poking fun at herself</b>

12:41.240 --> 12:43.200
<i>Why do you disrupt my work?</i>

12:46.360 --> 12:48.430
<i>Why do you bully me?</i>

12:50.870 --> 12:53.120
<i>I haven't done anything to you, have I?</i>

12:55.980 --> 13:00.590
<i>I know better than anyone what a failure I am.</i>

13:03.290 --> 13:05.370
<i>I won't ask you to accept me.</i>

13:06.520 --> 13:08.500
<i>I'd never ask something so selfish.</i>

13:10.070 --> 13:10.850
<i>So...</i>

13:12.210 --> 13:13.850
<i>please just leave me alone.</i>

13:16.780 --> 13:18.030
Please get out of my way.

13:29.780 --> 13:31.320
<i>I don't have the time.</i>

13:31.900 --> 13:33.870
<i>I can't afford to look away from my goal.</i>

13:36.470 --> 13:38.240
<i>I have to go.</i>

13:38.910 --> 13:40.600
<i>I have to make it to Elife!</i>

13:58.520 --> 14:01.440
Burn, cry, rage, fly!

14:01.760 --> 14:03.630
These skies belong to thy wings!

14:04.380 --> 14:07.610
I call thy name, guardian and fiery falcon...

14:11.150 --> 14:13.200
Halcon Gardinas!

14:16.260 --> 14:19.210
<i>A falcon made of flames? Is that a guardian?!</i>

14:19.630 --> 14:20.580
Go!

14:25.410 --> 14:27.220
<i>The guardian's attacking!</i>

14:30.040 --> 14:32.050
<i>If I can cut off its wings...</i>

14:32.980 --> 14:34.550
<i>This is my chance to get Sion!</i>

14:38.510 --> 14:39.690
<i>High-speed regeneration?</i>

14:40.980 --> 14:44.070
<i>I have to make sure to destroy 
its core or else it won't stop!</i>

14:44.070 --> 14:45.970
Get him, Halcon!

14:55.370 --> 14:59.040
<i>Guardians are mainly used to defend
and buy time for an incantation.</i>

14:59.040 --> 15:02.420
<i>But this one's attacking from all directions!</i>

15:19.650 --> 15:21.780
What tremendous proficiency.

15:21.780 --> 15:25.050
He's already surpassed the student level.

15:25.050 --> 15:27.280
Iflamme Burdelyon...

15:27.280 --> 15:30.610
Not only can he use a high-level fire spell,
he's even summoned a guardian.

15:30.610 --> 15:34.140
To think that he can execute 
such precise magic control on his own...

15:34.450 --> 15:36.250
What intel do we have on this student?

15:34.950 --> 15:39.250
<b>Fire Faction Scout
Rodge Holland</b>

15:36.250 --> 15:42.330
That is Sion Ulster, sir. He is the heir to 
House Ulster, masters of flame magic.

15:42.610 --> 15:45.780
According to the watchers'
reports, he has potential,

15:45.780 --> 15:50.430
but he falls behind Lihanna Owenzaus 
and the rest of the Top Three.

15:51.130 --> 15:54.100
So there's been some impetus for 
him to break through, has there?

15:55.290 --> 15:57.350
This is why you can never tell with students.

15:57.860 --> 16:00.240
Just when you think
 they're freshly hatched chicks,

16:00.240 --> 16:02.940
one comes along and transforms into a hawk.

16:02.940 --> 16:05.420
The Grand Magic Festival 
really is useful, isn't it?

16:06.340 --> 16:11.370
Report back to Lord Cariot. Tell him that 
there's an unexpectedly good crop.

16:12.150 --> 16:14.820
<b>Flame Emperor's Wand
Cariot Incindia Wiseman</b>

16:23.470 --> 16:24.660
<i>Sion...</i>

16:25.530 --> 16:27.030
<i>He's gotten stronger!</i>

16:27.720 --> 16:30.040
Is that all you've got, laggard?

16:30.740 --> 16:35.090
You were better than this when 
you defeated that Evil Sentinel!

16:36.600 --> 16:40.720
I don't understand, Sion.
Why are we doing this?

16:41.240 --> 16:43.600
There's no reason for you and I to fight!

16:46.190 --> 16:48.480
Are you seriously saying that?

16:49.240 --> 16:53.360
After being so ridiculed! 
After suffering such humiliation!

16:53.860 --> 16:57.490
After everything you've been through,
you're telling me you don't resent me?!

16:57.490 --> 17:01.170
I <i>do</i> resent you! And I'm furious!

17:01.170 --> 17:04.250
I've lost count of the times 
I've imagined getting back at you!

17:04.620 --> 17:08.340
But right now, I have to beat Julius!

17:08.340 --> 17:10.380
So I don't have time to fight you!

17:08.920 --> 17:10.380
Julius?

17:10.790 --> 17:12.880
Are you kidding me?

17:13.410 --> 17:17.010
The very sight of you irritates me
 so much I can't stand it!

17:17.010 --> 17:22.270
Watching you refuse to give up even though
you're just a no-talent infuriates me!

17:22.270 --> 17:27.020
And yet you... Why are you 
always looking everywhere but at me?!

17:27.020 --> 17:28.900
Don't ignore me!

17:30.650 --> 17:32.670
Look at me!

17:39.420 --> 17:43.820
<i>Sion... is that how you see me?</i>

17:44.910 --> 17:47.790
I don't care what your situation is!

17:47.790 --> 17:52.670
If you give me any more of that crap,
 I really will crush you right here!

17:56.800 --> 17:58.880
<i>I won't ask you to accept me.</i>

17:59.680 --> 18:01.610
<i>I couldn't ask for something so selfish.</i>

18:02.550 --> 18:07.150
<i>But if I'm being honest, somewhere deep 
in my heart, that is what I wanted.</i>

18:07.910 --> 18:12.570
<i>So if you're saying you'll 
acknowledge me, Sion...</i>

18:13.990 --> 18:17.480
<i>then I have to meet your challenge 
with everything I have!</i>

18:19.530 --> 18:23.580
You've finally got your eyes on me,
don't you, laggard?

18:24.550 --> 18:25.930
O sky stone!

18:25.930 --> 18:27.550
O will of Adras!

18:28.120 --> 18:31.160
Clad thyself in storm, sing of fiery calamity,

18:31.160 --> 18:33.590
rain down in the name of dragon-slaying!

18:34.300 --> 18:37.220
<i>The guardian will fend off any
sloppy attempts to get in close.</i>

18:37.220 --> 18:41.970
<i>So I just have to watch the timing
of his magic attack and go for a counter!</i>

18:42.520 --> 18:44.060
Fly, Halcon!

18:44.060 --> 18:46.060
Dragos Nowl!

18:46.520 --> 18:49.560
<i>Wide-scale destruction magic 
and a guardian strike?</i>

18:50.040 --> 18:51.440
<i>A simultaneous attack!</i>

18:55.530 --> 18:56.320
<i>Even so...</i>

18:56.680 --> 18:59.570
<i>I've already seen its path!</i>

19:09.340 --> 19:11.750
<i>He gave up on defending
against my destruction magic...</i>

19:13.230 --> 19:16.380
<i>and sliced through the guardian's core?!</i>

19:20.270 --> 19:23.300
This isn't over yet!

19:27.310 --> 19:30.810
Stop! This! Right! Now!

19:30.810 --> 19:31.830
Huh? Wait!

19:36.150 --> 19:37.430
Ow, ow...

19:41.030 --> 19:42.820
Colette?

19:43.300 --> 19:44.950
Wait, where's Julius?

19:45.530 --> 19:48.700
I kicked his butt! He suddenly
 disappeared on me, though.

19:49.270 --> 19:50.440
Disappeared?

19:52.920 --> 19:55.960
Colette! Have you seen yourself?!

19:55.960 --> 19:59.710
For the unwed daughter of a noble house

20:00.330 --> 20:02.610
to expose herself so indecently is just...

20:02.610 --> 20:03.810
<i>I'm</i> indecent?

20:03.810 --> 20:06.970
This is all <i>your</i> fault
for fighting in the first place!

20:09.940 --> 20:11.480
Will, you go on ahead.

20:11.740 --> 20:12.480
What?

20:13.290 --> 20:15.770
You've got a score to settle
with Julius, right?

20:15.770 --> 20:17.480
I can handle things here.

20:17.760 --> 20:21.990
You can't be serious, Colette!
 I won't let anyone get in my way, not even...

20:22.280 --> 20:24.530
You're the one who got in the way!

20:24.530 --> 20:28.060
This was Will's chance 
to look good for the tower!

20:32.370 --> 20:34.200
Thank you, Colette.

20:38.910 --> 20:40.660
H-Hey! Wait!

20:40.660 --> 20:43.510
Sorry, Sion! 
Let's have a real fight next time.

20:43.510 --> 20:44.820
Hey!

20:48.220 --> 20:53.780
You can't be serious! Fight me!

20:55.680 --> 20:58.440
Just moments from now,
after all the obstacles they've overcome,

20:58.440 --> 21:01.850
the lead squads will enter the stadium!

21:02.640 --> 21:07.200
Now, who will be the first to appear?

21:11.910 --> 21:17.000
It's Squad 9, led by Julius Reinberg!

21:19.000 --> 21:25.590
There's no one here to stop them. 
The glorious crown is as good as...

21:25.930 --> 21:26.630
Huh?

21:37.620 --> 21:39.610
Th-That's...

21:47.410 --> 21:48.360
Will!

21:52.380 --> 21:54.700
I'm challenging you, Julius.

23:37.770 --> 23:40.610
Next time on <i>Wistoria: Wand and Sword</i>,

23:40.610 --> 23:43.700
episode 7, "Twelve Secret 
Ice Magics, El Glace Frosse."

23:41.810 --> 23:46.070
Episode 7
Twelve Secret Ice Magics, El Glace Frosse
